sequenceDiagram
    participant Owner as Org owner or admin
    participant System
    participant Invitee

    Owner->>System: invite teammate by email + role
    System-->>Owner: pending invitation created
    System->>Invitee: invitation email

    alt Invitee accepts before expiry
        Invitee->>System: accept invitation
        System-->>Invitee: membership created, signed in
    else Invitee declines
        Invitee->>System: reject invitation
        System-->>Owner: invitation marked rejected
    else Owner changes their mind
        Owner->>System: cancel invitation
        System-->>Invitee: invitation no longer valid
    else Nobody responds
        System-->>System: invitation expires unused
    end
